279	      // failure, which would otherwise revert back to its own captured
280	      // "previous" value (true, the value before IT started). Even though
281	      // that happens to match here, the call must be recognized as
282	      // superseded and return `Left` rather than silently succeeding on a
283	      // value it no longer owns.
284	      firstPatchCompleter.complete(
